      "writtenOn": "2026-08-03T14:17:00Z",
      "side": 0,
      "message": "Good point — I\u0027ve since consolidated this: I removed http_auth_modes.hpp\nentirely and merged its contents into http_connect_types.hpp, so\nHttpType/getHttpType() and AuthMode/getAuthMode() now live together in a\nsingle shared header instead of being split across two files.\n\nAs for keeping getHttpType() inline in app.hpp: for it to work as a\nproper inline function (so it can be included and used across multiple\ntranslation units without violating ODR), it needs to be a free\nfunction rather than an App class method. Given that constraint, the\nmost natural place for it is alongside the HttpType enum it operates\non, rather than inside app.hpp.",
